["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/SupportType/endOfSupport", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "There is a defined end of support for the artifact from the supplier. This may also be referred to as end of life. There is a validUntilDate that can be used to signal when support ends for the artifact.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
